cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use hakutaku in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "hakutaku: code intelligence for AI agents first, people second"
abstract: >-
  hakutaku maps a code repository for AI agents first and people second: who
  calls what, what a change reaches, what matters most. It works from one
  local store, and never runs the repository's code. It answers through an MCP
  server, a CLI and a local viewer.
